[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":92},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","ufuof806zbxrnx8crlx9icj8k","revision",1,"title","亚马逊Listing优化漏斗排查法","originalTitle","Listing optimization comes down to a sales funnel:","summary","Listing 优化归结为一个销售漏斗：\n\n1. 被看见：SEO 和 PPC\n2. 被点击：主图、价格、评论\n3. 被购买：内容、A+、视频\n\n找出漏损的环节，优先修复它。","reason","source",{"_9":85,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":39,"_91":-5},"links",{"_82":83,"_66":84},"publishedAt","2026-10-10T23:22:07.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T16:14:18.230Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81],"score",22,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","1000asins","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>Listing optimization comes down to a sales funnel:</p><p>1. Getting seen: SEO and PPC<br>2. Getting clicked: main image, price, reviews<br>3. Getting bought: content, A+, video</p><p>Find the stage that's leaking and fix that one first.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Dan Boufford","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","Listing优化","aihot","/items/ufuof806zbxrnx8crlx9icj8k","https://x.com/1000asins/status/2109061947895202266","x-dan-boufford","name","X · Dan Boufford","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_93":94},"changelogVersion","2026-1